    "Roles are the five slots of the Nanda abstract template (Abstract",
    "section of the post): situate, gap, contribution, evidence, impact.",
    "Matching is case-insensitive on word boundaries. tier1.py combines",
    "these counts with position priors; docs/rubric.md documents the rule."
